OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sat 15 Aug to Mon 24 Aug
OL,6,FSunny spells and showers in the north
OL,7,Fon Saturday, with mainly dry weather
OL,8,Fin the south. Through Sunday and into
OL,9,Fthe start of the following week,
OL,10,FAtlantic frontal systems will probably
OL,11,Fapproach or move across the UK,
OL,12,Fbringing some rain in places, perhaps
OL,13,Fheavy at times. Temperatures will
OL,14,Flikely be near normal or slightly
OL,15,Fabove. Later in the period, high
OL,16,Fpressure will probably have more of an
OL,17,Finfluence with drier conditions
OL,18,Fdeveloping for many. Some rain is
OL,19,Fstill possible at times, particularly
OL,20,Fin the north, together with a risk of
OL,21,Fthunderstorms in the south.
OL,22,FTemperatures will likely be above
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,23,Fnormal.
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
